1
00:00:00,883 --> 00:00:02,443
(Bernadette:)Howie, you promised you'd move.

2
00:00:02,618 --> 00:00:04,988
- And I will.
- Yeah, right.

3
00:00:05,154 --> 00:00:10,214
I'm not going to live in my mother's house
for the rest of my life. I'm not a child.

4
00:00:10,593 --> 00:00:12,893
(Penny:)I've seen her burp you.

5
00:00:15,898 --> 00:00:16,958
(Howard:)She did not burp me.

6
00:00:17,132 --> 00:00:20,362
(Howard:)She was patting me on the back
and I happened to burp.

7
00:00:22,738 --> 00:00:25,228
(Howard:)Don't you have other tables
you should be waiting on?

8
00:00:25,407 --> 00:00:27,807
(Penny:)Yeah, but I told you, I'm not good at my job.

9
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:32,500
(Penny:)- Listen to me. He is never gonna leave.
- I'm starting to think you're right.

10
00:00:32,681 --> 00:00:36,741
(Howard:)All right, I've had enough of this.
I'm a grown man. I have a successful career.

11
00:00:36,919 --> 00:00:39,249
I mean, for the love of God,
I've been to space.

12
00:00:39,421 --> 00:00:43,251
(Howard:)I will move out when I'm ready, and I don't
need anyone badgering me into it.

13
00:00:43,959 --> 00:00:46,429
(Penny:)Wow. Excuse me.

14
00:00:47,896 --> 00:00:51,766
(Howard:)That was just for her benefit. I'll move
tomorrow. I love you. Don't leave me.

15
00:00:56,305 --> 00:00:57,775
Amy?

